WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.420
Well, you can't tell by the way I use my work

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.740
I'm a woman's man, no time to talk

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.020
The music, love, women, war

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.360
I've been kicked around since I was born

00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.640
I never thought it was right, that's okay

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.960
And you may look the other way

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:17.360
A weekend crash, a one-day state

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.720
The New York Times are best on me

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.040
Whether you're a brother or a wife, or you're a nothing

00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:24.300
Stayin' alive, stayin' alive

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.680
You feel the city breaking and everybody shaking

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:28.920
Stayin' alive, stayin' alive

00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:33.580
I, I, I, I, stayin' alive, stayin' alive

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:36.360
I, I, I, I, stayin' alive
